  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "This series, which compiles five stories drawn under a single theme, features \"love letters\" as its theme. The collection includes welcome contributions from seasoned artists.\n\nWhen You Get A Letter is a collection of colorful, gem-like stories ranging from romance-infused dramas, sci-fi, fairy tales, period dramas, and queer themes. Let’s take a look at five love letters that have reached both the sender, who has once written their heart on paper, and the recipient, who understands the feelings that can only be felt through a letter.\n\nStories featured:\n1. **Ineoui Yeonseo** (인어의 연서) \\[Gold Kiwi\\]\n2. **Wanbyeokan Sarangpyeonji** (완벽한 사랑편지) \\[Sanho\\]\n3. **Pyeonji Ilgeojwo!** (편지 읽어줘!) \\[Lee Gong Gong Gu\\]\n4. **Donghaereul Wihayeo** (동해를 위하여) \\[Ji-Hwan Min\\]\n5. **Yeeonui Susinin** (예언의 수신인) \\[Angram\\]",
